{"id": "fact_0bd878cfe58b3504ead738b5", "content": "在REPA数据集中，标注协议包含：3名母语为俄语的标注者、盲评（不告知LLM来源）、多数投票法解决分歧（若三人意见不同则排除样本），报告的一致性数值为95%以上。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_9c1dbc0dad9103cb3e763e43", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.13102", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2503.13102v2", "related_sections": ["agreement_protocol_operationalization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "cd0eb812403a0f2e7440e15944356afab27f0d1fa002a5e72cb6dca1e78cce88", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_2bdc5d12f24a1e76ef0a775f", "content": "该研究明确提及存在标注指南（annotation guidelines）和标注界面截图，表明协议具有明确的文档化规范。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_9c1dbc0dad9103cb3e763e43", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.13102", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "Appendix A presents annotation guidelines. The screenshot of the annotation interface is in Appendix B.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2503.13102v2", "related_sections": ["agreement_protocol_operationalization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "cd0eb812403a0f2e7440e15944356afab27f0d1fa002a5e72cb6dca1e78cce88", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_892df1e8e9fefe24a442935d", "content": "在评估LLM Judge与人工判断的一致性时，该研究使用准确率（Accuracy）作为主要指标，并针对MT-Bench中多人标注的情况，仅使用人类完全一致（unanimous）的子集进行计算。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_723b7a72be0650bb557a3fb8", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.03064", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2503.03064v2", "related_sections": ["agreement_protocol_operationalization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "3b04b2fbacbd3eaa5dec66f2af6c68e46be48c8f075653fab6cf7a2c00504c6d", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "method", "results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_a9bd2f806e551352b15d626a", "content": "研究发现离散方法（如mode）因预测大量平局（ties）而导致整体准确率偏低，但在非平局实例上其准确率与连续方法（mean）相似。这表明一致性/准确率的差异部分源于对“平局”的处理方式，而非单纯的判断能力差距。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_723b7a72be0650bb557a3fb8", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.03064", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2503.03064v2", "related_sections": ["agreement_protocol_operationalization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "3b04b2fbacbd3eaa5dec66f2af6c68e46be48c8f075653fab6cf7a2c00504c6d", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "method", "results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_9b37ed99538daa3cf8486484", "content": "当人类评审者与LLM Judge以不同方式解决评级不确定性时，基于强制选择（forced-choice）的一致性指标会导致次优的Judge系统选择。分布式指标（如KL散度）优于分类指标。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_7a32909d15c98fa26f52ab22", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.05965", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2503.05965v4", "related_sections": ["agreement_protocol_operationalization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "0c8159b0e09fd37adc2c103db41bb74eae6f0d1143e4c034bf0938adfcae14a6", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "results"]}
{"id": "fact_cd8b194cc9689aeb260ebfb7", "content": "研究采用 MTBench 和 DevBench 数据集，理由是这些数据集已显示出高的人工-LLM一致性（human-LLM agreement）以及经过验证的可靠性。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_9eea78d525de2a031f169fbd", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.07791", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "For datasets, we adopted the modified MTBench (Zheng et al., 2024b) and DevBench (Li et al., 2024a) due to their demonstrated high human-LLM agreement and the validated reliability of state-of-the-art LLM judges on the evaluation tasks.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2406.07791v9", "related_sections": ["bias_controls_randomization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "1511d5050351bba9cece4d0f790298da03db3ea4c26fad4c46143d55f78bb1f3", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_3e937765a6c9aa95a4d1e643", "content": "在评估位置一致性和偏好公平性时，使用了覆盖整个 MTBench 和 DevBench 数据集的大规模实例（分别为 4,800 和 2,240 个），并进行了重复试验以计算稳定性。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_9eea78d525de2a031f169fbd", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.07791", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2406.07791v9", "related_sections": ["bias_controls_randomization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "1511d5050351bba9cece4d0f790298da03db3ea4c26fad4c46143d55f78bb1f3", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_715ccbecf7cdce77b7635ca8", "content": "成对比较（Pairwise）方法在处理正常样本时表现良好，但在处理对抗性样本时容易受到内在偏差的影响，导致评估性能下降；相比之下，点式评估（Pointwise）受此类偏差影响较小。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_bef01d92f6985757ef78c5a2", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.12319", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "The pairwise approach excels with normal samples like those in MT-Bench since it can leverage contextual information by considering two outputs simultaneously. However, the benefits of the pairwise approach turn into drawbacks when handling adversarial samples in LLMBar, as it makes the evaluators more easily susceptible to intrinsic biases.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2406.12319v4", "related_sections": ["bias_controls_randomization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "09381c0f4197ea7132e841e485c5986d8e6234ab3ef06e2d6828241e1940b5ea", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_20b24f8025e643d7b762228a", "content": "在 MT-Bench 数据集中，成对偏好（Pairwise preferences）协议对干扰特征（如断言性、冗长性）高度敏感，导致偏好翻转率高；而绝对评分（Absolute scoring）协议表现出更强的鲁棒性，更能抵抗这种漂移。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_1ea6cebf5eb57ab7602e6ba7", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.14716", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2504.14716v2", "related_sections": ["bias_controls_randomization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "41dba3aca90863d801c87185495d136013020fac1749c88cdcec629e1157c802", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_00f9945ab533a8ecd9e0c191", "content": "在设计上质量匹配的数据集（IFEval-TweakSet）中，成对比较协议倾向于拒绝平局并显示干扰偏差，而绝对评分协议能更恰当地反映人为设定的“平局”地面真值，表现为高比例的相同分数。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_1ea6cebf5eb57ab7602e6ba7", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.14716", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "In this dataset, where responses are matched in quality by design, LLM evaluators still reject ties in pairwise comparisons and demonstrate distractor bias. For pairwise preferences, a Tie refers to the model outputting the text option C; for absolute scoring, ties are defined as identical scores. Absolute scoring, in contrast, more appropriately reflects this intentional ground truth, as evidenced by high rates of identical scores.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2504.14716v2", "related_sections": ["bias_controls_randomization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "41dba3aca90863d801c87185495d136013020fac1749c88cdcec629e1157c802", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_76873af5427a41635a853938", "content": "实验设置中，MTBench 采用两选项模式（Two-option mode），DevBench 采用三选项模式（Three-option mode），用于评估 LLM 评审的位置偏差。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_9eea78d525de2a031f169fbd", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.07791", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2406.07791v9", "related_sections": ["bias_controls_randomization"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "1511d5050351bba9cece4d0f790298da03db3ea4c26fad4c46143d55f78bb1f3", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "table"]}
